# Testing

Tests for this repository live in the paired repository **`<%= it.names.pairedName %>`**. That
repository checks this one out into `app/` in CI and runs the unit, scenario, integration and e2e
suites against it. `test` here prints this pointer and exits 1 on purpose.

Local setup:

1. Clone `<%= it.names.pairedName %>` next to this repository.
2. Inside it, clone or copy this repository into `app/` (ignored by its `.gitignore`).
3. Follow its README.
